SUMMARY:Information: TUBE STRIKE: Piccadilly line service control staff are
  planning to take strike action from Friday 20 until Saturday evening 21 
 November. Piccadilly line customers should complete journeys by 1030 on 
 Friday morning as service will begin to reduce after this time. There will
  be no service from midday on Friday until Saturday evening\, including 
 Night Tube on Friday night. Normal Night Tube service is expected to 
 operate on Saturday night. Due to shared infrastructure around the Ealing 
 Common District line depot\, there will be no DISTRICT LINE service 
 between Earls Court and Richmond / Ealing Broadway from midday on Friday 
 until Saturday evening. Replacement buses will operate during Friday Night
  Tube hours and Saturday daytime only. Please use ELIZABETH LINE services 
 for travel between Central London and Heathrow\, and METROPOLITAN LINE 
 services between Rayners Lane and Uxbridge.
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR